.TH MLNX_BF_CONFIGURE_OVS 8 "2026-10-15"
.SH NAME
mlnx_bf_configure_ovs \- configure Open vSwitch bridges on NVIDIA BlueField DPUs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mlnx_bf_configure_ovs
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mlnx_bf_configure_ovs
configures Open vSwitch (OVS) bridges and related settings on NVIDIA BlueField
DPUs.
It is designed to run as a systemd service
.RB ( mlnx_bf_configure_ovs.service )
after both
.B openibd
and
.B openvswitch
have started.
.PP
The script sources
.I /sbin/mlnx_bf_configure.env
for shared variables and helper functions, then performs the following:
.IP \(bu 2
Waits for
.B mlnx_bf_configure
to signal that device\-level configuration (switchdev mode, SFs, etc.) is
complete.
.IP \(bu 2
Cleans up DOCA hugepages if necessary.
.IP \(bu 2
Determines the required OVS bridge layout based on the eswitch mode
(switchdev / legacy) and the number of PCI uplinks.
.IP \(bu 2
Creates OVS bridges with the appropriate representor ports, including
support for per\-port VLAN settings (tag, vlan_mode, trunks) and MTU.
.IP \(bu 2
Enables OVS hardware offload when configured.
.IP \(bu 2
Restarts the OVS service if needed to activate hw\-offload.
.IP \(bu 2
Reapplies udev network settings after bridge reconfiguration.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is read from
.IR /etc/mellanox/mlnx\-ovs.conf .
Key variables include:
.TP
.B CREATE_OVS_BRIDGES
Set to
.I yes
to enable automatic OVS bridge creation (default:
.IR no ).
.TP
.B OVS_HW_OFFLOAD
Set to
.I yes
to enable OVS hardware offload.
.TP
.B OVS_BRIDGE1 ", " OVS_BRIDGE2
Custom bridge names (defaults:
.IR ovsbr1 ", " ovsbr2 ).
.TP
.B OVS_BRIDGE1_PORTS ", " OVS_BRIDGE2_PORTS
Space\-separated list of ports to add to each bridge.
.TP
.B OVS_BR_PORTS_TIMEOUT
Timeout in seconds waiting for representor netdevs to appear (default: 60).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SYNC_TIMEOUT
Maximum seconds to wait for
.B mlnx_bf_configure
to finish device configuration before giving up (default: 120).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /sbin/mlnx_bf_configure.env
Shared variables and helper functions sourced at startup.
.TP
.I /etc/mellanox/mlnx\-ovs.conf
OVS configuration file.
.TP
.I /run/mlnx_bf_configure_sync
Synchronisation file created by
.B mlnx_bf_configure
to signal readiness.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mlnx_bf_configure (8),
.BR doca\-hugepages (8),
.BR mlnx\-bf\-hugepages (8),
.BR ovs\-vsctl (8)
